{Advanced Amad}

Repairs the selected golem stack by restoring hit points and removing negative spells. Affected creatures: Flesh Golems, Stone Golems, Iron Golems, Gold Golems, Diamond Golems, Rusty Dragolems and Dragolems. Restored creatures remain after combat.

Provides an additional 10 hit points over Basic Amad.

{Expert Amad}

